OL,3,GNEWSAJeffrey Donaldson to be
OL,4,Ainterviewed over alleged rape inside
OL,5,AHouses of Parliament
OL,6,
OL,7,FJeffrey Donaldson is to be interviewed
OL,8,Fby London police about an alleged rape
OL,9,Fof a woman inside the Houses of
OL,10,FParliament, the BBC can reveal.
OL,12,FThe disgraced former MP has been
OL,13,Faccused of raping the woman in
OL,14,FWestminster in 2016, at the very heart
OL,15,Fof the political establishment.
OL,17,FIt is understood she has been
OL,18,Finterviewed by Police Service of
OL,19,FNorthern Ireland officers, who have now
OL,20,Fshared her claims with the Metropolitan
OL,21,FPolice, as the alleged incident
OL,22,Fhappened in London.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
